hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"230","The Prophet (ﷺ) said: ¤ ¤ ""Whoever prays for Allah's blessings upon me once, will be blessed for it by Allah ten times."
"231","The Prophet (ﷺ) said: ¤ ¤ ""Do not make my grave a place of ritual celebration, but pray for Allah's blessings upon me, for your blessings reach me from wherever you are."
"232","The Prophet (ﷺ) said: ¤ ¤ ""The miser is the one in whose presence I am mentioned yet does not pray for Allah's blessings upon me."
"233","The Prophet (ﷺ) said: ¤ ¤ ""Indeed Allah has angels who roam the earth and they convey to me the greetings (or prayers of peace) of my Ummah (nation)."
"234","The Prophet (ﷺ) said: ¤ ¤ ""No one sends greetings (or prayers of peace) upon me but Allah returns my soul to me so that I may return his greetings."
